Hi folks,

Still having issues. openCR 2.0.2 is failing to open preexisting RData files created with openCR 1.4. Well partially open. I can recall the

Variance-covariance matrix of beta parameters

But after that I get

Fitted (real) parameters evaluated at base levels of covariates

Error in object$details$minimumage:object$details$maximumage :

  argument of length 0

All attempts to run new models are giving me
Eigenvalues :  NaN NaN NaN NaN
Numerical rank of Hessian : 0  ( svtol = 1e-05 )
Warning: at least one real parameter is not identifiable

Variance-covariance matrix of beta parameters
        lambda0 phi D sigma
lambda0       0   0 0     0
phi           0   0 0     0
D             0   0 0     0
sigma         0   0 0     0

No errors are found in the capthist object and all plots of the mask appear correct.

I would really appreciate any help I can get on this front.

Thanks,

